			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Align binary entry module imports and remove re-exports\n\nStandardize imports for `ApplicationState` and `Track` command modules in `Entry.rs` and `AppLifecycle.rs` to use the explicit nested path `ApplicationState::State::ApplicationState::ApplicationState` and `Module::Submodule::Struct::Struct` respectively. This ensures consistency with the project's strict `Struct` naming convention and recent refactors in the `Track` subsystem.\n\nCondense multi-line `dev_log!` macro invocations in `AppLifecycle.rs` into single lines where width constraints allow, improving code density without altering logic. Additionally, remove the `pub use Entry::Fn as Main` re-export from `mod.rs` in favor of direct calls to `Binary::Main::Entry::Fn()` from `Library.rs::main`, simplifying the entry point API and enforcing explicit call paths.\n\nThese changes reduce vertical whitespace, enforce naming consistency, and streamline the binary initialization flow.",
			"SHA": "28fdb84dbfad1cefcede3e6a3276fe84ed98bba9"
		},
